---
/**
 * Wrapper for a tool's interactive app on its page.
 *
 * Exists so each tool MDX imports its OWN app component: with the previous
 * static componentMap in ToolPage, Vite bundled the CSS of every app into the
 * shared chunk and each tool page shipped the styles of all seventeen —
 * 68 KB of foreign rules per page, measured on /tools/csp-builder/
 * (2026-08-22). The `.tool-container` markup and style moved here verbatim
 * from ToolLayout, which no longer wraps its default slot.
 */
---

<div class="tool-container">
  <slot />
</div>

<style>
  .tool-container {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
